{"id":"f066c945ea5af293","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-quasivariety-hspp.md","title":"Quasivariety HSPP","display":"Quasivariety HSPP","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-quasivariety-hspp","aliases":["93-fact-quasivariety-hspp"],"display":"Quasivariety HSPP","depends_on":["[[93-df-quasivariety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-quasivariety-hspp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-quasivariety-hspp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Quasivariety HSPP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span> is a class of algebras of a fixed similarity type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced one-place validity predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}\\)</span> is the isomorphic-copy/subalgebra/product/ultraproduct closure of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\">\\(\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\\)</span> is the least quasivariety containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span>, as defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathbb K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathbb K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The ultraproduct operator is essential in the general generation theorem:\nquasivarieties are precisely classes axiomatized by quasi-identities and\nclosed under isomorphisms, subalgebras, direct products, and ultraproducts.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasivariety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}$ is the isomorphic-copy/subalgebra/product/ultraproduct closure of [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)$ is the least quasivariety containing $\\mathbb K$, as defined in [[93-df-quasivariety]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}hspp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\n\\to\\operatorname{QGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathbb K)\n=\\mathrm{ISPP}_{U,\\tau}(\\mathbb K).","display":true}],"bytes":1306,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["14fa67446efa83b1","97b46a497e251f9f","6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}